# Sigarda's Aid: "Whenever an Equipment you control enters, you may attach it to target creature you control." The target
# is chosen as the ability goes on the stack (CR 603.3d) and the attaching is a "may" made on resolution (CR 603.5).
# With an Ornithopter and Llanowar Elves Bot1 aims Lightning Greaves at the Elves and accepts. Lavaspur Boots then has one
# creature to aim at, the Ornithopter (the Elves have shroud from the Greaves, CR 702.18), so it is chosen without asking;
# Bot1 declines, and the Boots stay unattached.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Sigarda's Aid
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Lightning Greaves
Lavaspur Boots
Swamp x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
